Chapter: Ed25519 Small Order Test

  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter Ed25519

 The all-zero key and signature encode a point of order 4 as A and as R with
 S = 0, which the verification equation accepts exactly when h is 3 mod 4. The
 four messages below are [b, 0 x 31] with b = 1, 0, 8, 4, whose h under that key
 is 0, 1, 2 and 3 mod 4, so one of them is the accepting class. RFC 8032 test 1
 is the control that must verify, and its S + L is the same scalar written
 non-canonically.

Section: Definitions

  zeros : Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  zeros (n) (acc) =
    if n <= 0 then acc
    else zeros (n - 1) (list-push acc 0)

  verdict : Boolean -> Text
  verdict (ok) = if ok then "accepted" else "refused"

  zero-key-line : Integer, Integer -> Text
  zero-key-line (b) (h-class) =
    let msg = [b] & zeros 31 []
    in "zero key, zero signature, h = " & show h-class & " mod 4: " & verdict (ed25519-verify (zeros 32 []) msg (zeros 64 []))

  rfc-pub : List Integer = [215, 90, 152, 1, 130, 177, 10, 183, 213, 75, 254, 211, 201, 100, 7, 58, 14, 225, 114, 243, 218, 166, 35, 37, 175, 2, 26, 104, 247, 7, 81, 26]

  rfc-r : List Integer = [229, 86, 67, 0, 195, 96, 172, 114, 144, 134, 226, 204, 128, 110, 130, 138, 132, 135, 127, 30, 184, 229, 217, 116, 216, 115, 224, 101, 34, 73, 1, 85]

  rfc-s : List Integer = [95, 184, 130, 21, 144, 163, 59, 172, 198, 30, 57, 112, 28, 249, 180, 107, 210, 91, 245, 240, 89, 91, 190, 36, 101, 81, 65, 67, 142, 122, 16, 11]

  rfc-s-plus-l : List Integer = [76, 140, 120, 114, 170, 6, 78, 4, 157, 187, 48, 19, 251, 242, 147, 128, 210, 91, 245, 240, 89, 91, 190, 36, 101, 81, 65, 67, 142, 122, 16, 27]

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("rfc8032 test 1: " & verdict (ed25519-verify rfc-pub [] (rfc-r & rfc-s)))
    print-line-uni ("rfc8032 test 1, S + L: " & verdict (ed25519-verify rfc-pub [] (rfc-r & rfc-s-plus-l)))
    print-line-uni (zero-key-line 1 0)
    print-line-uni (zero-key-line 0 1)
    print-line-uni (zero-key-line 8 2)
    print-line-uni (zero-key-line 4 3)
  end
